<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - Dutch Aug output seen up 3.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Dutch Aug output seen up 3.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank economists expect Dutch August manufacturing production data on Tuesday to show a rise of 3.7 percent compared with the same month of 1995.</p>
<p>Economists' forecasts are summarised below:</p>
<p>GMT--Date--Period--Indicator-----------Consensus--Range----Pvs 0730 15/10 Aug     Manufac output y/y  +3.7 pct   3.0/4.7  +4.7</p>
<p>Forecasts were contributed by ABN AMRO, ING, Generale Bank and Rabobank.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
